Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 07:23:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add a guest agent that keeps the clock in step with Windows

The agent connects out to the launcher at 10.0.2.2:4451 like the clipboard bridge, announces itself, and applies time messages: when the guest clock differs from the host's by more than two seconds it is stepped. The launcher sends the time on connect, periodically, and after Windows resumes from sleep. Ships in the compat overlay; integration revision 8.
